eumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/run.sh:# the harden/converge pattern of \"look up the signal file, prepend the path\" so","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TT2qPdF9rLAHNrvVUCFZTN","session_id":"5a7c94be-b519-4ed0-b07c-6b329c049eda","uuid":"298e819e-6cdf-4329-b5f1-d343afe878cb","timestamp":"2026-05-27T07:39:47.415Z","subagent_type":"Explore","task_description":"Explore almanac codebase friction"}
