{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018NF61GephLga9hBwytQNP5","type":"tool_result","content":"/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/loops.sh:#   launch  — exec_argv: how to exec its runner (config in, _ALMANAC_LOOP_ARGV out)\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/agent.sh:# argv populates the global _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV; callers use almanac_provider_call\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/agent.sh:# SHAPE into _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV. Returns 3/4 (with a diagnostic) on an unknown/\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/agent.sh:  local cmd=(\"${_ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV[@]}\")\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/agent.sh:  local cmd=(\"${_ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV[@]}\")\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/agent.sh:  local cmd=(\"${_ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV[@]}\")\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/codex.sh:#   argv         — populate _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV with the exec tokens (no prompt)\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/codex.sh:# Build codex's exec argv into _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV (the prompt is appended by the\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/codex.sh:  _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV=(\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/codex.sh:  [ \"$shape\" = \"raw\" ] || _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV+=(--json)\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/codex.sh:  _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV+=(--output-last-message \"$result_file\")\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/codex.sh:  [ -n \"$model\" ]  && _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV+=(--model \"$model\")\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/codex.sh:  [ -n \"$effort\" ] && _ALMANAC_AGENT_ARGV+=(-c \"model_reasoning_effort=\\\"$effort\\\"\")\n/Users/jakubneumann/Documents/code/neumie/almanac/lib/providers/claude.sh:#   argv       — populate _ALMANAC_AGENT_AR